{"v":1,"source":"Moonton (mobilelegends.com)","patch":"2.2.16","updated":"2026-10-08","hero":{"name":"Paquito","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5ab87805b9107b126a3bab64a8a199ad.png","head_big":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/gms/image/1be4eba1fa94d906a631125ab5fc9c7b.jpg","square":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_02466a857c46760a78265713eab7e39c.jpg","squarebig":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ef4c59d1923663a6aaa77d1c0a7ff258.jpg","smallmap":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_7d54ccba749ba18ec934631b49632d1f.png","wallpaper":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e57019805d928c886bd0ae01b8947c30.png","hero_id":103,"wallpaper_source":"painting"},"stats":{"win":50.32,"pick":1.64,"ban":38.96},"compat":{"metric":"pp","best":[{"hero":"Alice","value":1.3},{"hero":"Harith","value":1.1},{"hero":"Aulus","value":0.8},{"hero":"Natan","value":0.7},{"hero":"Zhuxin","value":0.7}],"worst":[{"hero":"Minsitthar","value":-1.6},{"hero":"Jawhead","value":-1.3},{"hero":"Fanny","value":-1.2},{"hero":"Chou","value":-1.2},{"hero":"Cici","value":-1.1}]},"lore":{"short":"A mortal hero who fights demons with nothing but his fists—and the iron will to protect his tribe.","long":null},"meta":{"difficulty":"90","speciality":["Chase","Damage"],"roadsort":["Exp Lane"],"sort":["Fighter","Assassin"],"recommend":"3-2-1","sorticon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_1660a04f7dc87095c97aaf32f44d685c.png","roadicon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9a93311ae387f9ffe5a7efa5e341eb9e.png"},"skills":[{"id":10340,"name":"Champ Stance","description":"Paquito gains a stack each time he casts a skill. At 3 stacks, he enters the Champ Stance and enhances his next skill.\nPaquito's enhanced skills have no cooldown and deal (+2*Hero Level)% extra damage to minions.\n\nAfter casting any enhanced skill, Paquito gains 60% Movement Speed and (+2*Hero Level)% Damage Reduction for 1.2s.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_355d974ddddee49aa368a23ce6261325.png","video":null,"cd":null,"cost":null,"is_passive":true,"tags":[{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"},{"name":"Damage","rgb":"199,121,85"}]},{"id":10310,"name":"Heavy Left Punch","description":"Paquito throws a punch in the target direction, dealing 210 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit and gaining a 150 (+135% Total Physical Attack) shield.\n\nChamp Stance: The damage is increased to 350 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage, and the shield value is increased to 140% for 2.5s (normal and enhanced shields can stack).","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_272a8e256ea04a2cc61624913c1a3a0d.png","video":null,"cd":7.0,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"AOE","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"Shield","rgb":"89,168,111"}]},{"id":10320,"name":"Jab","description":"Paquito dashes forward and throws a jab, dealing 200 (+165% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in his path and at the destination.\n\nChamp Stance: Paquito's jab becomes fiercer, dealing 300 (+210% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit.\nThe jab stops upon hitting a hero or creep.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c25b703eaad4be83ff1d2f9d8376efa6.png","video":null,"cd":7.0,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Burst","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"Mobility","rgb":"162,105,198"}]},{"id":10330,"name":"Knockout Strike","description":"Paquito launches an elbow strike at enemies in the target direction, dealing 250 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and knocking them back to the destination.\nHe then throws a haymaker, dealing 300 (+90% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and slowing them by 75% for 1s, before darting backward.\n\nChamp Stance: After knocking enemies back to the destination, Paquito launches an uppercut instead, dealing 400 (+120% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and knocking them airborne for 0.5s.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_526a9945a05f076fe151ede742bd3d48.png","video":null,"cd":15.0,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"CC","rgb":"205,93,109"},{"name":"Burst","rgb":"199,121,85"}]}],"counters":{"assist":{"desc":"Paquito works best with support heroes who can buff him, like Angela and Rafaela.","heroes":[{"id":55,"name":"Angela","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c7e0183956b2c2fd6d3fa0b18fe46917.png"},{"id":14,"name":"Rafaela","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_68277dce415742c4a98883151c693a07.png"}]},"strong":{"desc":"Paquito is a hero with dash and high burst damage, making him strong against squishy heroes without defensive abilities, such as Gord and Layla.","heroes":[{"id":23,"name":"Gord","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9513f5e10ec33f76747732eaf2082259.png"},{"id":18,"name":"Layla","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b2b38e9406ea0de0b866db7674feea0f.png"}]},"weak":{"desc":"Paquito is an agile hero, but he is also kind of squishy, which makes him weak against heroes with strong CC abilities. Such as Franco and Kaja.","heroes":[{"id":10,"name":"Franco","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9bed3c0095335606e0ce616c6e5a8553.png"},{"id":62,"name":"Kaja","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d558bb881e18a070eaeda1e1fdc248a8.png"}]}},"official_url":"https://play.mobilelegends.com/